        "node_id": "n_13_4af5e4",
        "thought_text": "The current binary search approach might not be efficiently handling the large range of possible x and y values (up to 10^9). Consider optimizing the binary search to focus on the median values of x and y coordinates, as these are likely to minimize the Manhattan distance.",
