        "node_id": "n_14_b27655",
        "thought_text": "Instead of checking all citizens for each potential intersection, try to precompute or filter out citizens who are already beyond the maximum allowed distance d from any possible intersection. This could significantly reduce the number of checks needed during the binary search.",
